		"32091": [
			"The Scav spawn mechanics on The Labs work differently to other maps.\n\nScav Raiders will begin spawning after 5 minutes.  Every couple of minutes there is a chance a Scav Raider will spawn. They can spawn anywhere and patrol anywhere.\n\nGroups of 2-4 Scav Raiders will also spawn when any of the extraction buttons are pressed (you'll hear an announcement on the intercom).  When this happens, they spawn nearby the relevant extraction and patrol towards it.",
			[]
		],
